{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "9eae99eebb9f1aede5c5a434cbfedecd76aeb411ae648bb9d593d1de4f4b8137", "ja": "Performance ～新しい自分を～", "zh": "Performance ～崭新的自己～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82742dc258bd7ea55c6cd34e8c0b3d11bf95f96ceaeb57b82268dce6b7f1a254", "ja": "社長から託されたのは、疾走感のあるクール\nな楽曲。誰に任せようか思案していたプロデ\nューサーは、千鶴と雪歩に託す事を決める。\n狙いは、普段のイメージと違う曲で、\nふたりの新しい魅力を見せる事。", "zh": "社长交托的是一首充满疾驰感的酷炫乐曲。正在思量该交给谁的制作人，决定将其托付给千鹤和雪步。目的是通过一首与平日印象截然不同的曲子，展现两人全新的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "569037fede65979d871b657dff2c3ba66780a8ad5655f9c630d4f89af4b7866e", "ja": "（社長から託された新曲。この曲に込められた\nメッセージを届けるのに相応しいアイドルといえば）", "zh": "（社长托付给我们的新歌。要说适合传达这首歌所蕴含的信息的偶像……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "bc1c8e8aba070bd9db95ebe4b2f1e13917492985230f8bdc52f70235c83e69ab", "ja": "まぁ！　では雪歩ちゃんは、そんなにたくさんの\nお弟子さんと、一緒に暮らしているんですの？", "zh": "哎呀！那么雪步，你是和那么多的\n弟子生活在一起的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0a4df0ea97aa4f15df03c23b8c2db72b35b19c7d3ecb37704aaca5730ee96403", "ja": "はい、みなさん住み込みなので。でもいまだに、\nちょっとだけ、緊張しちゃう時があって……。", "zh": "是的，大家都是住在这里的。不过直到现在，偶尔还是会有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8312149f1a132b80b60a6a8be32662ee58e6a0a91c2ba5906766150a708ba0f7", "ja": "千鶴さんのお家は、どうですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐的家怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "15e54cfbfe15d8ff2c1b0f2fa6f229b6810d14539a6cf36d338be4e3c0492a3c", "ja": "へ？　わ、わたくし？", "zh": "诶？我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1218133baf4abfb1f10f71808c47f32a3bb79c9572abd0f1baaf07b59bdee0fb", "ja": "はい。千鶴さんのお家にも、伊織ちゃんのお家\nみたいに、働いている人が大勢いるのかなって……。", "zh": "是的。我是在想，千鹤小姐家里是不是也和伊织小姐家里一样，有很多佣人在工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "7f650890991e744a09500692479bbb5d8a5b9d17b1c61e14dc3fa1344ad403cb", "ja": "え、ええ！　もちろんいますわよ！\n執事とシェフが、住み込みで！", "zh": "诶、诶！当然有呀！\n管家和厨师都是住家工作的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bf512d6b6180780dadbe624f7c1d4062e4e4394cde54578f670848f8be3559a1", "ja": "千鶴さん、雪歩、お疲れさまです。\n……なんだか盛り上がってるみたいですね？", "zh": "千鹤、雪步，辛苦了。\n……感觉你们好像聊得很热闹啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "d1bbed2a6bae07e5989cbc33ff8223f6da2484db4231fde17661aa5db0015ef1", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nいま雪歩ちゃんと、家の話をしていたんですのよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n我刚才正和雪步聊家里的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b181683487ddc8cee63c48475a713778ee09090ebf8ac05b18cd520fb8999532", "ja": "{$P$}、千鶴さんのお家も、\n働いている人が大勢いるそうですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，听说千鹤小姐家里也有很多人在工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1503fcb36314b709593c3d445ec59ecb62542150ca5bb6096be3bba9beaaf93e", "ja": "そういえば雪歩の家も、\nお弟子さんが大勢いるんだったな。", "zh": "说起来，雪步家里也有很多弟子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9508960492667161c7d9ef852a4bcaf21a57abfaba8d6d1f4c8037576cd53c26", "ja": "はい。けど私、どうしても慣れなくて……\n家のお弟子さんたち、もう何年もいるのに。", "zh": "是的。不过我无论如何都习惯不了……\n家里的那些弟子明明已经待了好几年了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ff6bcaa89b1c23ce796f839eb73cfa1b8d136fe976c9e1373ebb6265376a224b", "ja": "千鶴さんは、緊張したりしないんですか……？", "zh": "千鹤不会紧张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "caf6000e57e5709cb8377427d5fdf5a07704556897c32c8c19a9eec7f1117907", "ja": "そうですわね……わたくしの場合は、慣れ親しんだ\n家族のようなものですから。苦手意識は、特に……。", "zh": "是啊……对我来说，他们就像熟悉的家人一样。所以，并没有特别觉得难以应付……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a8f3f3637bbcd4cb62c5a092da67658e1324c907fe8da46580d0549acb35b2f5", "ja": "うう、いいなぁ……。私も、男の人が苦手なの、\n何とか克服したいって思ってるんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜，真羡慕啊……我也一直想着\n要是能想办法克服怕男人的毛病就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ab0261c7ad791bd18f3798f60e2abdc61b34e757ed7788e9c022828f7fbc69e0", "ja": "克服したい気持ちがあるなら、十分だよ。\nできることから頑張っていこう！", "zh": "只要有想克服的心情，就已经足够了。\n从力所能及的事情开始努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "0d4188e5679bcaf7d49119c456f948c093751f8abbf3a045b3b7965924e7dbb9", "ja": "そうですわ。それに、{$P$}とは\n普通に話ができていますもの。", "zh": "是的。而且，我已经能和{$P$}正常交谈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "f45df9727372da751798b80e96288b861562ec3d5a8db02b230bd588612e7d29", "ja": "時間はかかるかもしれませんが、いつかきっと、\n男性への苦手意識も薄れてきますわ。", "zh": "也许需要一些时间，但总有一天，\n对男性的抵触感一定会慢慢消散的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c9542b79550edd9ccf63809b1469ba4c1e0864acc7065a9ddf26b15560baf88e", "ja": "{$P$}、千鶴さん……\nはい！　あ、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "{$P$}，千鹤小姐……\n好的！啊，谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bba4096dc176c132a83977cad82f8d1ae39bb48ab3d5c9d8a364a0f977fe64a7", "ja": "（自分を変えたいと思っている雪歩。\nそして、千鶴さん。やっぱり、このふたりに……）", "zh": "（想要改变自己的雪步。\n还有千鹤小姐。果然，对这两个人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "c138942fda5f11b64115e930d4fa0cc243cd59f59fec112f651e5192ed1e8c4b", "ja": "あら、つい話し込んでしまいましたわね。それで\n{$P$}、お話ってなんですの？", "zh": "哎呀，不知不觉就聊得这么起劲了呢。那么，\n{$P$}，您想谈的是什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "28beec63cf1cddacd7a3d87ffd22611b9ee2985b9b253d4736445a73c6b48253", "ja": "はい、その事なんですけど。\nふたりに、聴いて欲しい曲があって……。", "zh": "是的，就是那件事。\n有首歌想让你们两位听听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_1023", "source_sha256": "3a08e80bb4091b29875286f3dcc5c6fce4663584f917292a1b56a6de51ebbdcc", "ja": "曲を流す", "zh": "播放乐曲", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "ed62cf61e09e159be0cdeeba4e51f664dd5dd739da48df261637ed7be7f3b615", "ja": "まぁ……まぁ、まぁ！\n素敵な曲ですわね！　雰囲気があって……。", "zh": "哎呀……哎呀，哎呀！\n真是首美妙的曲子呢！很有氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0753117b1fcfc3fd2d1a7afe14f65fd352368a67d6efba87b78e1839b741f240", "ja": "すごく、カッコいい曲になりそうです……！\nファンの人たちも、よろこんでくれそう……。", "zh": "感觉会是一首非常帅气的歌……！\n粉丝们应该也会很开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2003_p", "source_sha256": "93b80309a4317847f3676a99a57e831cf61ac189bebfad8bfd0f3cc3d92f424b", "ja": "好感触みたいでよかった。千鶴さん、雪歩……\nふたりで、この曲を歌ってみませんか？", "zh": "感觉还不错真是太好了。千鹤小姐、雪步……\n要不要由你们两个人，来唱这首歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d6cfd1a7624c5cecbb788699674dcfe792ba93fd3eafde8c0668c4059d71ef7e", "ja": "えっ……えええっ！？\nわ、私たちが、この曲を……？", "zh": "咦……诶诶诶！？\n我、我们要唱这首歌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2005_038chz", "source_sha256": "b54b4ab3ee1e51f74290e519b33b14e4d4fc104ccdfad3a6a815056264be97fe", "ja": "光栄ですけど……わたくしも雪歩ちゃんも、本来\nこういった曲とは、縁遠いイメージなのでは？", "zh": "虽然很荣幸……但不论是我还是雪步，给人的印象本来应该都和这类歌曲相去甚远吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2006_038chz", "source_sha256": "fd9be11ce9b662dceabf53e3614f352b1ecf270a8e91a93a5788115a6af0c8b5", "ja": "{$P$}。\n……何か、理由がありますの？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n……有什么理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2007_p", "source_sha256": "8edda8feb737e7348c06a8d2de336cbfce3af2edfed53d6d6f0c06ed6b270cc2", "ja": "理由ですか？\nそうですね……何となく、ですかね。", "zh": "是理由吗？\n这个嘛……该怎么说呢，只是觉得吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2008_038chz", "source_sha256": "43cf31d605f670e6fd33755343ef7b6d4b6fcd795cd1cab5b029f380e12c1bae", "ja": "そんな適当でいいんですの！？", "zh": "这么随便也行吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "567ba2fc2b45113991cc7b26c79346a1e4820110503631ddf3cc5104221a6b54", "ja": "すみません、冗談です。\nもちろん、フィーリングも決め手ではありますが。", "zh": "对不起，开个玩笑。\n当然，感觉也是决定因素之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2010_p", "source_sha256": "277c7feaac82bf0a4ec35bbdb7ef4fd8698755a6b683cf074a765f69d06de19a", "ja": "普段のイメージとは違う曲を歌う事で、ふたりの\n新しい魅力を見せる、いい機会かなと思ったんです。", "zh": "我觉得，通过演唱与平时印象不同的曲子，也许是展现两人全新魅力的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "044e2eed44c91cdbb53e48039c00b7d88d738b38cdad430f7aa5cbdbbcd5ae09", "ja": "新しい魅力……ですか？", "zh": "新的魅力……是指这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2012_p", "source_sha256": "f6bc087c68cf17dde785abb552651d6cedd5610c826de891aa73f58c75b97afe", "ja": "ああ。それに、今のふたりの実力なら、\nこの曲もきっと歌いこなせる。間違いない。", "zh": "啊。而且，以你们两人现在的实力，\n这首歌肯定也能唱好。不会错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2013_038chz", "source_sha256": "3b953189c3833d9f8b6d01877188340cbe8747c61ab031304ad011779dda3b6b", "ja": "な、なるほど……話は分かりましたわ。\n雪歩ちゃんは、どう思いまして？", "zh": "原、原来如此……我明白了。\n雪步，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f50131ab23fba7023210f23321197cb125e6eeb1b1aa87da8afb0fbc584b61df", "ja": "わ、私は……チャレンジ、してみたいです！\n上手く歌えるか、自信はないですけど……。", "zh": "我、我……想挑战一下！\n虽然没信心能唱好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c417d52b44189c4949faf019572b2fc8a6685065a47e6cb85c116509bc9acf29", "ja": "でも、もしかしたら……ダメダメな自分を変える、\nチャンスかもしれませんから！", "zh": "但是，说不定……这可能是改变那个一无是处的自己的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2016_038chz", "source_sha256": "e3ad2670a16d8451fdd62c24e3802eff60f29ce1606963364b623ed3aa0fb6ca", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん……そうですわね。\nわたくしも、挑戦させていただきますわ！", "zh": "雪步……确实如此。看来我也得接受这次挑战了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2017_p", "source_sha256": "930c0ba62179bc41eb05f84e2c8b9586e9a7e92e24f5852dc05fff2b6c3bc58c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nじゃあ早速、打ち合わせをお願いできますか？", "zh": "谢谢您！\n那么现在就开始商量，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "52c1f0ac6ce53eda42596cb665df9c525a860526dd4fa2ee67b6f9a991e613a3", "ja": "は、はいっ。\n千鶴さん、よ、よろしくお願いしますぅ！", "zh": "好、好的。\n千鹤小姐，请、请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2019_038chz", "source_sha256": "0e3faef249486edf7a2e4f5dcffd85d318bb623c20092ff6e1d542f2b4681f66", "ja": "もちろんですわ。わたくし達の新しい魅力、見つけて\nみせますわよ！　おーっほっほ……ゲホッ、コホッ！", "zh": "当然了。我们一定会找到属于我们的全新魅力！哦——呵呵呵……咳咳、咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0154_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_01_2020_p", "source_sha256": "64e08f83bf0a33c9c4092604c498618f8c23d58aa8484d88955386c90d48d0c1", "ja": "（ふたりとも、やる気十分だ！\nこのユニット、転機になるかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（两个人都干劲十足！\n这个组合，说不定会成为一个转折点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
